    "sections": {
        "description": "An accessible, framework-free WooCommerce block theme. MM Store is built on block templates and theme.json, uses the current WooCommerce blocks for the shop, product, cart and checkout, and adds accessible variation swatches, AJAX add to cart for the single-product form and a Frequently Bought Together section driven by native cross-sells. It loads no remote fonts, icons or frameworks."
